                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gummeré to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tangier</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-30"><hi rendition="#italic">May 30,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Gummeré reports the arrival of the American man-of-war <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Brooklyn</hi>, and that there have been no further
                    developments.)</p>
            </div>
